{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12106","headline":"过曹钧隐居 · 钱起","name":"过曹钧隐居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荃蕙有奇性，馨香道爲人。\n不居衆芳下，宁老空林春。\n之子秉高节，攻文还守真。\n素书寸阴尽，流水怨情新。\n济济振缨客，烟霄各致身。\n谁当举玄晏，不使作良臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12106.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12106","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}